1 . FX Optimization Engine
	•	A marketplace-wide FX routing system that always uses the best rate from OpenFx platform:
	•	Marketplace can monetize by charging a small transparent FX fee.

2. Real time Dynamic Currency Conversion (DCC) at Checkout
	•	Show buyers prices in their local currency, even if the merchant operates in USD or EUR.
	•	Conversion happens at checkout. Merchant still gets paid in their preferred settlement currency.
  •	Complete transparency for each stakehold of the transaction at checkout.
	•	Win-win: Better buyer experience, no FX risk for the seller.

3. Compliance and Reconciliation Engine
	•	A reporting product for merchants and marketplace admin.
	•	Shows payments received in multiple currencies.
	•	Displays FX rates + conversion fees.
	•	Auto-generates tax + accounting reports for cross-border transactions.

4. Multi-Currency Wallets for Merchants
	•	A wallet product where merchants can receive, hold, and withdraw in multiple currencies.
	•	Auto-convert at favorable times (merchant chooses).
	•	Multi-currency balance for paying suppliers or affiliates abroad without double conversion.
	•	Example: A German seller keeps USD from US buyers → later pays a Chinese supplier in USD, skipping EUR ↔ USD ↔ CNY conversion costs.
